      <p class="mt-[18px] font-disp font-normal text-[clamp(1.15rem,2.2vw,1.6rem)] leading-[1.3] text-ink max-w-[46ch]">We strive for a world where all living beings thrive and communities decide their own futures, free from corporate greed and state domination.</p>
