      <h2 class="{{ display }} max-w-[24ch]">Meet the builders <span class="font-light">of Bonfire.</span></h2>
      <p class="{{ bodyp }}">We're a small crew of maintainers and contributors, who organise using consent-based <a href="https://www.sociocracyforall.org/sociocracy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">sociocratic models</a> to coordinate tasks and make decisions among us. If you are interested in actively participating in our collective and pushing Bonfire forward we invite you to abide by our <a href="/conduct">code of conduct</a> and get involved!</p>

      <p class="mt-10 font-smono text-[.72rem] font-bold tracking-[.16em] text-ink-3">Maintainers circle</p>
